        "created_at": "2013-01-24T13:56:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a card says \"prevent the next 2 damage dealt\" but doesn't have an expiration date like at the start of your round, and you continue to stack damage prevention effects?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>for instance, the wraith says \"prevent the next 2 damage dealt to the wraith\" but if she takes no Damage, can she stealth again to add another 2 points of damage reduction? &nbsp;I imagine this isn't the case at all, but I just want to double check</p>",
