        "created_at": "2013-01-24T13:59:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is exactly the case. If she takes no damage she could use stealth again and gain an additional reduction. Making it&nbsp;reduce the next damage taken by 4. Though it would be fairly sad if a attack deals her 1 which would get rid of all her reduction. But it is nice when you can for see a massive attack coming out and getting her next turn!</p>",
