        "created_at": "2013-01-24T17:06:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Melonball\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/46a35a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Melonball:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If a card says \"prevent the next 2 damage dealt\" …</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In order to stay clear on how this works, in my mind I transform it to \"Prevent 2 of the next damage dealt\".</p>",
